/* understory — the hand.
 * Geometry derived from the MakeHuman base mesh (hm08), released to the public
 * domain under CC0 in September 2020 by Data Collection AB, Joel Palmius and
 * Jonas Hauquier. Subdivided, voxelised to a signed distance field, carved and
 * re-meshed offline; what follows is a zlib stream of the surface-net cells for
 * the shell and for the rock inside the cavity. */
